O      O        1     0.998628    0.000000    0.837527 1
O      O        1     0.042970    0.000000    0.388706 1
V      V        1     0.726188    0.000000    0.442899 1
V      V        1     0.524869    0.500000    0.597414 1
Zn     Zn       1     0.781429    0.000000    0.717422 1
